      "text": "Trigger: user removes spec.externalApplicationDatabaseRef\nfrom the OM CR (MongoDB CR stays alive during handoff).\nSafe sequence: remove ref -> wait for handoff -> then delete CR",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r3",
      "originalText": "Trigger: user removes spec.externalApplicationDatabaseRef\nfrom the OM CR (MongoDB CR stays alive during handoff).\nSafe sequence: remove ref -> wait for handoff -> then delete CR",
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "baseline": 52
